 6052	5337					; ------------------------------------------------------------------
 6053	5337					; check_tile_interaction
 6054	5337					; Purpose:
 6055	5337					;   Scan active input-driven entities against the interactable tile map,
 6056	5337					;   collect matching tiles, update counters, optional target variable, sound,
 6057	5337					;   and persistent collected-tile state.
 6058	5337					; Input:
 6059	5337					;   None (reads active_entity_list / active_entity_count and runtime maps)
 6060	5337					; Output:
 6061	5337					;   None
 6062	5337					; Clobbers:
 6063	5337					;   AF, BC, DE, HL
 6064	5337					; Preserves:
 6065	5337					;   IX, IY, SP
 6066	5337					; Stack:
 6067	5337					;   Uses balanced push/pop pairs for list pointer, loop counter/entity index,
 6068	5337					;   and temporary tile index saves on all exit paths.
 6069	5337					; Notes:
 6070	5337					;   - Returns immediately if active_entity_count = 0
 6071	5337					;   - Relies on FAST_WRTVRM preserving all registers
 6072	5337					;   - DE must survive the optional HUD/sound hooks until persistence logic runs
 6073	5337					; ------------------------------------------------------------------
