 19606	9EBC					; EFFECT 5: SPIRAL - Pixel-row resolution via color table manipulation
 19607	9EBC					; Clears pixel rows from outside in (top+bottom simultaneously).
 19608	9EBC					; Works by setting color table bytes to 0x11 (black fg + black bg)
 19609	9EBC					; for all 256 tile patterns at the given pixel sub-row in each bank.
